{"id": "d1d37ed07f34", "repo": "tenstorrent/tt-llk", "fix_commit": "d1d37ed07f34538046fce3f41fc98b93ef941973", "files": ["tt_llk_blackhole/llk_lib/llk_assert.h", "tt_llk_wormhole_b0/llk_lib/llk_assert.h"], "class": "tt-dead-llk-assert", "component": "llk/assert", "summary": "The disabled LLK_ASSERT macro used (void)condition without parentheses, so a compound condition parsed with the wrong precedence."}
